00:00:26.871 --> 00:00:29.240
- And I started actually
writing a science fiction novel.

00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.371
That it had been an idea
I've been playing with

00:00:31.371 --> 00:00:33.376
a long time called Avalon.

00:00:33.376 --> 00:00:38.174
And I was working on Avalon
and it was coming pretty well,

00:00:38.174 --> 00:00:40.787
and suddenly the first
chapter of Game of Thrones

00:00:40.787 --> 00:00:43.760
