00:00:54.614 --> 00:00:55.864
- It's a freak.

00:00:57.573 --> 00:00:59.633
- It's a direwolf.

00:00:59.633 --> 00:01:01.383
- I know it wasn't part of
the science fiction novel

00:01:01.383 --> 00:01:03.070
I was writing, this was clearly a fantasy,

00:01:03.070 --> 00:01:07.629
medieval, had these wolves
and this large family.

00:01:07.629 --> 00:01:09.617
I had been reading a lot
of historical fiction,

00:01:09.617 --> 00:01:12.570
and that might have been
in the back of my mind,

00:01:12.570 --> 00:01:15.344
but suddenly it all gelled,
and I wrote that chapter

00:01:15.344 --> 00:01:17.088
in like two or three days.

00:01:17.088 --> 00:01:19.015
It just came to pour out of me.

00:01:19.015 --> 00:01:21.932
